{
 "total": 661.29,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Multan.",
   "start": 7.72,
   "end": 8.31,
   "idx": 0
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "September 1949.",
   "start": 9.64,
   "end": 11.68,
   "idx": 1
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "A prison cell.",
   "start": 14.27,
   "end": 15.12,
   "idx": 2
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "One small lamp.",
   "start": 16.34,
   "end": 17.54,
   "idx": 3
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "And a man bent over a page.",
   "start": 18.67,
   "end": 20.62,
   "idx": 4
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "His name is Sayyid Abul A'la Mawdudi, rahimahullah.",
   "start": 22.77,
   "end": 26.29,
   "idx": 5
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "He is writing the preface to a book he began seven years earlier.",
   "start": 27.44,
   "end": 30.79,
   "idx": 6
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "A book that would travel far beyond that cell.",
   "start": 31.86,
   "end": 34.44,
   "idx": 7
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Tafhim al-Qur'an.",
   "start": 36.47,
   "end": 37.8,
   "idx": 8
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Towards Understanding the Qur'an.",
   "start": 39.03,
   "end": 41.63,
   "idx": 9
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Before the book, he wrote a short preface.",
   "start": 43.65,
   "end": 46.03,
   "idx": 10
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Only nine pages.",
   "start": 47.0,
   "end": 47.95,
   "idx": 11
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Most people skip it.",
   "start": 48.88,
   "end": 50.22,
   "idx": 12
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "But in those nine pages, he tells you how to meet the Book of Allah.",
   "start": 50.35,
   "end": 54.25,
   "idx": 13
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "So let's not skip it.",
   "start": 55.29,
   "end": 56.19,
   "idx": 14
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "He begins with an honest question.",
   "start": 60.12,
   "end": 61.85,
   "idx": 15
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Shelves were already full of translations and tafsir.",
   "start": 62.89,
   "end": 65.67,
   "idx": 16
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "So why add one more?",
   "start": 66.7,
   "end": 68.0,
   "idx": 17
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Writing another one just for the blessing of it, he says, is not a good use of time anymore.",
   "start": 70.01,
   "end": 74.9,
   "idx": 18
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "It is only worth it if it fills a gap.",
   "start": 75.9,
   "end": 78.18,
   "idx": 19
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "A need that the earlier works left unmet.",
   "start": 79.11,
   "end": 81.44,
   "idx": 20
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And he had seen that need for years.",
   "start": 84.66,
   "end": 86.83,
   "idx": 21
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Ordinary, educated Muslims wanted to reach the spirit of the Qur'an.",
   "start": 87.82,
   "end": 91.86,
   "idx": 22
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "They wanted to know what this Book is really asking of them.",
   "start": 92.82,
   "end": 95.63,
   "idx": 23
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "The translators had done valuable work.",
   "start": 97.58,
   "end": 99.58,
   "idx": 24
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "And still, he writes, that longing stayed thirsty.",
   "start": 100.63,
   "end": 103.67,
   "idx": 25
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "He felt he could help quench that thirst.",
   "start": 105.66,
   "end": 107.86,
   "idx": 26
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "And those two feelings, the thirst he saw and the help he could give, became this book.",
   "start": 108.84,
   "end": 114.82,
   "idx": 27
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "So who is it for?",
   "start": 116.63,
   "end": 117.88,
   "idx": 28
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Not the scholars.",
   "start": 118.92,
   "end": 119.79,
   "idx": 29
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "They already have plenty.",
   "start": 120.0,
   "end": 121.03,
   "idx": 30
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "It is for people like you and me.",
   "start": 122.0,
   "end": 123.74,
   "idx": 31
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "People who did not study Arabic.",
   "start": 124.71,
   "end": 126.33,
   "idx": 32
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "So he left out the debates that only specialists need.",
   "start": 127.33,
   "end": 130.0,
   "idx": 33
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "His aim was simple.",
   "start": 131.9,
   "end": 133.21,
   "idx": 34
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "That you understand what Allah is saying, clearly.",
   "start": 134.15,
   "end": 137.19,
   "idx": 35
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "And that you feel what the Qur'an wants you to feel.",
   "start": 138.15,
   "end": 140.54,
   "idx": 36
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "Where a doubt comes up, he answers it right there.",
   "start": 141.53,
   "end": 144.06,
   "idx": 37
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 12,
   "text": "And then, with real humility, he asks his readers and the scholars: show me where I fell short.",
   "start": 145.9,
   "end": 151.7,
   "idx": 38
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 12,
   "text": "This is not the last word.",
   "start": 152.65,
   "end": 154.01,
   "idx": 39
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Then comes the heart of the preface.",
   "start": 156.93,
   "end": 159.1,
   "idx": 40
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "How do you carry the Qur'an into another language?",
   "start": 160.31,
   "end": 163.1,
   "idx": 41
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "He chose a free rendering.",
   "start": 165.49,
   "end": 167.18,
   "idx": 42
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "He calls it tarjumani.",
   "start": 168.28,
   "end": 169.68,
   "idx": 43
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Not because word-for-word translation is wrong.",
   "start": 170.82,
   "end": 173.16,
   "idx": 44
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Great scholars had done it beautifully: Shah Waliullah in Persian, and in Urdu Shah Abdul Qadir, Shah Rafiuddin, Mawlana Mahmud al-Hasan, Mawlana Ashraf Ali Thanawi, and Hafiz Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari.",
   "start": 174.18,
   "end": 186.6,
   "idx": 45
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Word for word teaches you what every word means.",
   "start": 187.68,
   "end": 191.21,
   "idx": 46
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "That is a real gift.",
   "start": 191.32,
   "end": 192.19,
   "idx": 47
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "But for someone who doesn't know Arabic, he says, it has weaknesses.",
   "start": 194.48,
   "end": 198.61,
   "idx": 48
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And the first one is life.",
   "start": 199.75,
   "end": 201.29,
   "idx": 49
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "You read a literal translation, and the words just lie there.",
   "start": 205.2,
   "end": 209.24,
   "idx": 50
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Your heart is not moved.",
   "start": 211.47,
   "end": 212.63,
   "idx": 51
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "The hair on your skin does not rise.",
   "start": 213.83,
   "end": 215.8,
   "idx": 52
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "No tears come.",
   "start": 216.88,
   "end": 218.49,
   "idx": 53
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Nothing stirs inside you.",
   "start": 218.61,
   "end": 219.87,
   "idx": 54
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And a terrible thought creeps in.",
   "start": 222.14,
   "end": 223.99,
   "idx": 55
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Is this really the Book that challenged the whole world?",
   "start": 225.07,
   "end": 228.19,
   "idx": 56
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "He says a literal translation is like a sieve.",
   "start": 230.41,
   "end": 233.12,
   "idx": 57
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "The dry ingredients of the medicine pass through.",
   "start": 234.15,
   "end": 236.4,
   "idx": 58
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "But the living spirit of the language flies away, above it.",
   "start": 237.36,
   "end": 240.69,
   "idx": 59
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And the Qur'an's power was in its language as much as in its teaching.",
   "start": 242.84,
   "end": 246.62,
   "idx": 60
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "That is what melted hearts of stone.",
   "start": 247.64,
   "end": 249.76,
   "idx": 61
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "That is what struck Arabia like lightning.",
   "start": 250.67,
   "end": 252.98,
   "idx": 62
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Its fiercest enemies were afraid that whoever listened to it would lose his heart to it.",
   "start": 253.94,
   "end": 258.35,
   "idx": 63
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "Had it come in the language of its translations, he says, it could never have done that.",
   "start": 260.52,
   "end": 265.19,
   "idx": 64
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "The second weakness is flow.",
   "start": 268.89,
   "end": 270.6,
   "idx": 65
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Translations sit between the lines, or on half a page.",
   "start": 271.64,
   "end": 274.92,
   "idx": 66
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Fine for study.",
   "start": 275.91,
   "end": 276.64,
   "idx": 67
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "But you cannot read them straight through, like a book.",
   "start": 277.56,
   "end": 280.04,
   "idx": 68
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "English is even worse.",
   "start": 281.12,
   "end": 282.3,
   "idx": 69
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Every verse cut out and numbered.",
   "start": 282.6,
   "end": 284.48,
   "idx": 70
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Take any beautiful piece of writing, he says, and number its sentences.",
   "start": 286.54,
   "end": 290.67,
   "idx": 71
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Half of its effect is gone.",
   "start": 291.67,
   "end": 293.19,
   "idx": 72
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "And then a point he calls very important.",
   "start": 296.19,
   "end": 299.16,
   "idx": 73
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "The Qur'an is speech.",
   "start": 300.45,
   "end": 302.06,
   "idx": 74
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Not writing.",
   "start": 303.16,
   "end": 303.8,
   "idx": 75
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "It did not come down as a printed book.",
   "start": 306.02,
   "end": 308.25,
   "idx": 76
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "As the call to Islam moved forward, Allah sent down an address for each moment, and the Prophet, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, delivered it to people like a khutbah.",
   "start": 309.45,
   "end": 318.71,
   "idx": 77
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And speech works differently.",
   "start": 320.75,
   "end": 322.25,
   "idx": 78
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "On paper, you first write the objection, then the answer.",
   "start": 323.43,
   "end": 326.63,
   "idx": 79
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In a speech, the objectors are standing right there.",
   "start": 327.76,
   "end": 330.33,
   "idx": 80
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "So the answer simply comes.",
   "start": 331.33,
   "end": 332.7,
   "idx": 81
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "On paper, you must describe the setting.",
   "start": 333.94,
   "end": 336.02,
   "idx": 82
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In a speech, the setting is all around.",
   "start": 337.17,
   "end": 339.41,
   "idx": 83
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And in a speech, the voice turns.",
   "start": 341.64,
   "end": 344.03,
   "idx": 84
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "People are spoken about, then spoken to.",
   "start": 345.21,
   "end": 347.87,
   "idx": 85
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "One person, then many.",
   "start": 348.99,
   "end": 350.38,
   "idx": 86
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Sometimes the speaker speaks for himself, sometimes for a group, sometimes on behalf of Allah.",
   "start": 351.56,
   "end": 356.87,
   "idx": 87
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And sometimes, Allah Himself speaks.",
   "start": 358.04,
   "end": 360.66,
   "idx": 88
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Heard aloud, this is beauty.",
   "start": 362.83,
   "end": 364.8,
   "idx": 89
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "On paper, it can feel disconnected.",
   "start": 366.13,
   "end": 368.07,
   "idx": 90
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "In Arabic, not one letter may be changed, so only notes can help.",
   "start": 369.24,
   "end": 373.19,
   "idx": 91
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "But in another language, if the speech is carefully turned into written style, the gap closes.",
   "start": 374.36,
   "end": 379.42,
   "idx": 92
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Every surah came for a moment.",
   "start": 383.77,
   "end": 385.77,
   "idx": 93
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "It had a background, and a need it came to meet.",
   "start": 386.92,
   "end": 389.3,
   "idx": 94
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Strip that away, and some things are not understood at all.",
   "start": 390.5,
   "end": 393.37,
   "idx": 95
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Some are understood upside down.",
   "start": 394.42,
   "end": 396.06,
   "idx": 96
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "So a rendering should carry some of that background with it.",
   "start": 397.21,
   "end": 400.11,
   "idx": 97
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "And the Qur'an has its own vocabulary.",
   "start": 403.56,
   "end": 405.9,
   "idx": 98
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "A language within the language.",
   "start": 406.96,
   "end": 408.58,
   "idx": 99
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Take one word.",
   "start": 410.81,
   "end": 411.59,
   "idx": 100
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Kufr.",
   "start": 412.82,
   "end": 412.97,
   "idx": 101
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In one place it means complete disbelief.",
   "start": 414.34,
   "end": 416.55,
   "idx": 102
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, simple denial.",
   "start": 417.68,
   "end": 419.16,
   "idx": 103
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, only ingratitude.",
   "start": 420.17,
   "end": 422.04,
   "idx": 104
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, falling short in something faith requires.",
   "start": 423.07,
   "end": 425.99,
   "idx": 105
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, believing in principle, but refusing in practice.",
   "start": 427.16,
   "end": 430.5,
   "idx": 106
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And in another, obeying on the outside, while disbelieving inside.",
   "start": 431.52,
   "end": 435.34,
   "idx": 107
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "Translate it as kufr everywhere, and you are technically correct.",
   "start": 437.54,
   "end": 440.93,
   "idx": 108
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "But the reader will miss it here, misread it there, and get lost somewhere else.",
   "start": 442.12,
   "end": 446.23,
   "idx": 109
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "So here is what he did.",
   "start": 449.13,
   "end": 450.88,
   "idx": 110
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He did not dress the Qur'an's words in Urdu clothes.",
   "start": 452.31,
   "end": 455.33,
   "idx": 111
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He read a passage.",
   "start": 456.72,
   "end": 457.54,
   "idx": 112
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He took the meaning he understood, and the effect it left on his own heart.",
   "start": 458.75,
   "end": 462.77,
   "idx": 113
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "And he carried that, as faithfully as he could, into his own language.",
   "start": 463.96,
   "end": 467.97,
   "idx": 114
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Clear Arabic should become clear Urdu.",
   "start": 470.25,
   "end": 472.92,
   "idx": 115
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "The flow of speech should come through.",
   "start": 474.07,
   "end": 476.16,
   "idx": 116
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "And the majesty of Allah's words should shine, as far as possible.",
   "start": 477.21,
   "end": 481.26,
   "idx": 117
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "That needed freedom.",
   "start": 483.84,
   "end": 485.24,
   "idx": 118
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "But this was the Word of Allah.",
   "start": 486.51,
   "end": 488.37,
   "idx": 119
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "So he writes: I used this freedom… while very much afraid.",
   "start": 490.78,
   "end": 495.17,
   "idx": 120
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "And he never stepped beyond what the Qur'an's own words allow.",
   "start": 497.55,
   "end": 501.21,
   "idx": 121
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "What a rendering cannot carry, he gave you in two more ways.",
   "start": 505.21,
   "end": 508.78,
   "idx": 122
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Before every surah, an introduction: when it came down, what was happening, where the call to Islam stood, and what it was facing.",
   "start": 509.87,
   "end": 517.39,
   "idx": 123
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And notes, but only in two kinds of places.",
   "start": 518.48,
   "end": 521.07,
   "idx": 124
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Where a question would rise in your mind.",
   "start": 522.1,
   "end": 523.86,
   "idx": 125
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And where you might hurry past, and miss the real spirit of a verse.",
   "start": 524.89,
   "end": 528.5,
   "idx": 126
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Nothing that pulls your eyes away from the Qur'an.",
   "start": 529.47,
   "end": 532.05,
   "idx": 127
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "And then he gives you a way to read.",
   "start": 535.84,
   "end": 537.93,
   "idx": 128
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "One.",
   "start": 539.11,
   "end": 539.45,
   "idx": 129
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read the surah's introduction, and come back to it as you go.",
   "start": 540.5,
   "end": 543.58,
   "idx": 130
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Two.",
   "start": 544.82,
   "end": 545.13,
   "idx": 131
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Take your daily portion, and first go through it word for word, verse by verse, in whatever language you like.",
   "start": 546.15,
   "end": 552.94,
   "idx": 132
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Three.",
   "start": 553.96,
   "end": 554.28,
   "idx": 133
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read his rendering of that portion straight through, without the notes, so the whole message stands before you at once.",
   "start": 554.34,
   "end": 560.2,
   "idx": 134
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Four.",
   "start": 561.32,
   "end": 561.59,
   "idx": 135
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Go back, verse by verse, with the notes.",
   "start": 562.6,
   "end": 565.15,
   "idx": 136
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Read like this, he says, and an ordinary reader will come to know the Qur'an well.",
   "start": 567.48,
   "end": 572.16,
   "idx": 137
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Maybe not like a scholar.",
   "start": 573.22,
   "end": 574.35,
   "idx": 138
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "But well, in sha' Allah.",
   "start": 575.36,
   "end": 576.56,
   "idx": 139
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He began in February 1942.",
   "start": 579.51,
   "end": 582.43,
   "idx": 140
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "For more than five years he wrote, until he reached the end of Surah Yusuf.",
   "start": 583.72,
   "end": 587.93,
   "idx": 141
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Then life left him no time to write, or even to revise.",
   "start": 589.21,
   "end": 592.75,
   "idx": 142
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Call it a blessing in disguise, or a hardship, he writes.",
   "start": 594.76,
   "end": 599.74,
   "idx": 143
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In October 1948, he was suddenly arrested and taken to jail.",
   "start": 601.76,
   "end": 606.13,
   "idx": 144
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And there, behind the bars, he found the time the book needed.",
   "start": 607.31,
   "end": 611.11,
   "idx": 145
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "He ends with a dua: that this work truly helps the servants of Allah understand the Qur'an.",
   "start": 613.14,
   "end": 618.83,
   "idx": 146
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And one line in Arabic.",
   "start": 619.94,
   "end": 621.22,
   "idx": 147
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Wa ma tawfiqi illa billah.",
   "start": 623.26,
   "end": 625.52,
   "idx": 148
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "My success is only through Allah.",
   "start": 626.76,
   "end": 628.99,
   "idx": 149
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "A prison cell.",
   "start": 633.01,
   "end": 633.85,
   "idx": 150
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "One small lamp.",
   "start": 635.11,
   "end": 636.3,
   "idx": 151
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And a book that travelled far beyond it.",
   "start": 637.44,
   "end": 639.67,
   "idx": 152
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Now it is in your hands.",
   "start": 641.8,
   "end": 643.35,
   "idx": 153
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read the setting.",
   "start": 644.38,
   "end": 645.14,
   "idx": 154
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Learn the words.",
   "start": 646.12,
   "end": 647.01,
   "idx": 155
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Hear it whole.",
   "start": 647.94,
   "end": 648.75,
   "idx": 156
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Then go deep.",
   "start": 649.92,
   "end": 651.05,
   "idx": 157
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Open Tafhim al-Qur'an.",
   "start": 653.11,
   "end": 654.56,
   "idx": 158
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Start with one surah.",
   "start": 655.69,
   "end": 656.84,
   "idx": 159
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And let it reach your heart.",
   "start": 657.91,
   "end": 659.0,
   "idx": 160
  }
 ]
}